Elite Infected Patrol Captain.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A high-ranking officer tasked with hunting the Infected of Ursus. Greedy and cold-blooded. They are not a part of the army, and are generally despised by Ursus soldiers and city officials alike.","abilities":["Can use long-ranged weapons to attack <Ursus Civilians> and <Talulah, the Fighter>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.1,"stats":{"hp":4300,"atk":400,"def":150,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"elite_famiglia_crossbowman":{"slug":"elite_famiglia_crossbowman","name":"Elite Famiglia Crossbowman","icon":"/enemies-icons/Elite Famiglia Crossbowman.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Famiglia-trained crossbowmen with a wealth of experience. Their shots are more accurate, and more deadly as well. Famiglie always respect the ironclad order, so these crossbows are never upgraded into better models, and Arts remain just as essential as ever.","abilities":["While under the Asset Liquidation status, attacks are converted into Arts damage"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":5500,"atk":380,"def":200,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.8}},"norport_civilian":{"slug":"norport_civilian","name":"Norport Civilian","icon":"/enemies-icons/Norport Civilian.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Ordinary folk scattered throughout Norport Borough. Abandoned by Londinium and subjected to the Sarkaz's high-handed blockade, these orphans have become the ones most deeply affected by the haze of war.","abilities":["Friendly Unit","Once their identity is confirmed, restores your max DP after retreating to the Objective Point"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.65,"stats":{"hp":5000,"atk":250,"def":50,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"siracusan_civilian":{"slug":"siracusan_civilian","name":"Siracusan Civilian","icon":"/enemies-icons/Siracusan Civilian.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"These Siracusan civilians seem to have strayed into the fighting despite having been evacuated along with the rest of the crowd earlier. For whatever reason, whenever an accident of any sort happens, everyone's wrath falls upon you.","abilities":["Gradually reduces Blood Debt over time while on the battlefield; however, increases Blood Debt by a significant amount upon dying"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":3000,"atk":0,"def":50,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":null}},"ursus_civilian":{"slug":"ursus_civilian","name":"Ursus Civilian","icon":"/enemies-icons/Ursus Civilian.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"An ordinary Ursus citizen caught in the crossfire. A part of the cruelty and suffering of this world.","abilities":["Does not deplete Life Points when spared, but will deplete a Life Point upon dying","Does not count towards the defeated enemies counter"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.65,"stats":{"hp":3500,"atk":0,"def":50,"res":null,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":null}},"famiglia_terrorizer":{"slug":"famiglia_terrorizer","name":"Famiglia Terrorizer","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Terrorizer.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An exceptionally